# MotCamera5 uses the Qualcomm camera post-processing/fastrpc path. Qualcomm
# policy already defines vendor_snapcam_app for this workload; package mapping
# is kept in seapp_contexts instead of broadening generic priv_app. Its stock
# policy intentionally limits appdomain access to vendor_qdsp_device; the
# dedicated domain supplies secure DSP access through vendor_xdsp_device.
